*.index.bin
# Everything the language generator (lang-data-gen.mjs) produces. It is derived
# from GGG's game data, and the whole point of generating it per installation
# is that nobody redistributes that data: each operator processes only what GGG
# served them. It is also regenerated on every patch, so carrying it in history
# would be pure churn. data/en is different — that one comes from APT upstream.
de/items.ndjson
de/stats.ndjson
*/text-pairs.ndjson
